{% comment %}
  SECTION: Illuminate Labs Certification + Verified Spec Panel
  Add to Shopify: Online Store → Themes → Edit code → Sections → Add a new section
  → name it "pc-certification" → paste this in → Save.
  Then: Customize → drag "Certification" into place on the homepage
  (recommended: right after the hero, before or after the ingredients section).

  Every number here is from the Illuminate Labs certified panel (per 10g serving),
  signed 2026-07-29 — see:
  Sales_motor/07-Project_info/certifications/README_Illuminate_Labs_Certification.md
  Do NOT add a protein gram figure or "no vanilla" claim to this section — both are
  open discrepancies against the certified document (see README above) until
  Illuminate Labs reissues a corrected panel.

  CORRECTED 2026-08-27 — per direct correction from Illuminate Labs: the
  certification is a review of our DECLARED formula/ingredient amounts against
  published safety and efficacy research, not a laboratory test that measured
  those amounts in a physical sample. The doses below are what we formulated
  and declared; Illuminate Labs' role was checking those declared amounts
  against the science (taurine dose vs. endurance research, caffeine dose vs.
  EFSA safety threshold, banned-ingredient screen, MD review) — not assaying a
  bottle. Never write "checked," "verified the amounts," or similar language
  that implies lab measurement of the product itself. "Reviewed against
  published research" is accurate; "verified" on its own is not.
{% endcomment %}

<section class="pc-cert" id="certification">
  <div class="pc-cert__inner">

    <div class="pc-cert__seal">
      <img
        src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/lacerdareis-ai/power_coffee_repo@0924894715dc585b9f8182655cc23afac4ea9189/daily_content/_brand_kit/illuminate_labs_certified_seal.png"
        alt="Illuminate Labs Certified — third-party, medically reviewed"
        loading="lazy"
        width="220"
        height="330"
      >
    </div>

    <div class="pc-cert__content">
      <span class="pc-cert__eyebrow">Independently reviewed</span>
      <h2 class="pc-cert__title">Our formula, checked against the research by someone who isn't us.</h2>
      <p class="pc-cert__subtitle">
        These are the amounts we formulated — not a lab test of a bottle.
        Illuminate Labs reviewed our declared ingredients and doses against
        published safety and efficacy research, so the numbers below aren't
        just our word for it.
      </p>

      <div class="pc-cert__grid">
        <div class="pc-cert__stat">
          <span class="pc-cert__stat-value">~175mg</span>
          <span class="pc-cert__stat-label">Natural Caffeine</span>
        </div>
        <div class="pc-cert__stat">
          <span class="pc-cert__stat-value">2.1g</span>
          <span class="pc-cert__stat-label">Taurine</span>
        </div>
        <div class="pc-cert__stat">
          <span class="pc-cert__stat-value">207mg</span>
          <span class="pc-cert__stat-label">Ginkgo Biloba Extract</span>
        </div>
        <div class="pc-cert__stat">
          <span class="pc-cert__stat-value">~1.8g</span>
          <span class="pc-cert__stat-label">Thermogenic Spices</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="pc-cert__grid-caption">Formulated amounts, per 10g serving — reviewed for safety and efficacy against published research.</p>

      <p class="pc-cert__footnote">
        Reviewed for medical accuracy by Devin Dunatov, MD · Certified July 29, 2026
      </p>
    </div>

  </div><!-- /.pc-cert__inner -->
</section>

<style>
.pc-cert {
  background: #171412;
  color: #F7F0E0;
  padding: 80px 24px;
  font-family: -apple-system, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
}

.pc-cert__inner {
  max-width: 1080px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr;
  gap: 56px;
  align-items: center;
}

.pc-cert__seal {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  background: #F7F0E0;
  border-radius: 18px;
  padding: 24px;
}

.pc-cert__seal img {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 220px;
  height: auto;
}

.pc-cert__eyebrow {
  display: inline-block;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #D9A633;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.pc-cert__title {
  font-size: clamp(26px, 3.4vw, 38px);
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1.2;
  color: #F7F0E0;
  margin: 0 0 18px;
}

.pc-cert__subtitle {
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: rgba(247,240,224,0.65);
  max-width: 560px;
  margin: 0 0 36px;
}

.pc-cert__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr));
  gap: 2px;
  background: rgba(247,240,224,0.06);
  border: 1px solid rgba(247,240,224,0.08);
  border-radius: 12px;
  overflow: hidden;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.pc-cert__stat {
  background: #1E1A17;
  padding: 22px 20px;
  text-align: left;
}

.pc-cert__stat-value {
  display: block;
  font-size: 26px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: #D9A633;
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}

.pc-cert__stat-label {
  display: block;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: rgba(247,240,224,0.65);
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
}

.pc-cert__grid-caption {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: rgba(247,240,224,0.4);
  margin: 0 0 20px;
}

.pc-cert__footnote {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: rgba(247,240,224,0.45);
  margin: 0;
}

@media (max-width: 720px) {
  .pc-cert {
    padding: 56px 16px;
  }
  .pc-cert__inner {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
  }
  .pc-cert__seal {
    max-width: 200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .pc-cert__subtitle {
    max-width: 100%;
  }
}
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Certification",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
